{"id":"a1.u08","level":"A1","order":8,"title":{"en":"Shopping","ru":"Покупки"},"description":"Ходим по магазинам: одежда, цены, просьбы и оплата. How much, can для просьб, местоимения me, him, her, them.","goals":["Могу назвать одежду и деньги: shirt, coat, euro, cash.","Могу спросить цену: How much is this shirt?","Могу попросить в магазине: Can I try it on? Can I pay by card?","Могу сказать, что вещь дорогая или дешёвая.","Могу использовать me, him, her, them: Give me the bag. I like them.","Могу написать короткий текст о покупках."],"grammar":["a1.how-much","a1.can-requests","a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":["word-order","tenses"],"texts":[{"id":"a1.u08.shop","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"In the shop","ru":"В магазине"},"speakers":[{"id":"anna","name":"Anna","voice":"female"},{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"anna","en":"Excuse me, how much is this shirt?","ru":"Извините, сколько стоит эта рубашка?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"It is twenty euros.","ru":"Двадцать евро."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"And how much are these jeans?","ru":"А сколько стоят эти джинсы?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"They are forty euros. They are cheap.","ru":"Сорок евро. Они недорогие."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"Can I try them on?","ru":"Можно их примерить?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes, you can. What size do you need?","ru":"Да, можно. Какой размер вам нужен?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"I need a small size. I like them. Can I pay by card?","ru":"Мне нужен маленький размер. Они мне нравятся. Можно заплатить картой?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes, you can. Or you can pay with cash.","ru":"Да, можно. Или можно заплатить наличными."}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"a1.u08.max-coat","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"Max needs a coat","ru":"Максу нужно пальто"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"Max needs a new coat. In the shop the coat costs two hundred euros. It is expensive, and he doesn't buy it.","ru":"Максу нужно новое пальто. В магазине пальто стоит двести евро. Оно дорогое, и он его не покупает."},{"en":"On Saturday he goes to the market. There is a nice coat there. It costs fifty euros, and he buys it.","ru":"В субботу он идёт на рынок. Там есть хорошее пальто. Оно стоит пятьдесят евро, и он его покупает."},{"en":"He wears the coat every day. His sister likes it, and she wants a coat too. She goes to the market with him.","ru":"Он носит пальто каждый день. Его сестре оно нравится, и она тоже хочет пальто. Она идёт на рынок вместе с ним."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"a1.u08.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Одежда и деньги","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e01","hint":"Jeans и shoes — всегда во множественном числе.","explanation":"Shirt — рубашка, jeans — джинсы, shoes — туфли, coat — пальто, dress — платье.","difficulty":1,"words":["shirt","jeans","shoes","coat","dress"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"shirt","ru":"рубашка"},{"en":"jeans","ru":"джинсы"},{"en":"shoes","ru":"туфли"},{"en":"coat","ru":"пальто"},{"en":"dress","ru":"платье"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e02","hint":"Euro и dollar — виды денег.","explanation":"Money — деньги, cash — наличные, euro — евро, dollar — доллар, price — цена.","difficulty":1,"words":["price","money","cash","euro","dollar"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"money","ru":"деньги"},{"en":"cash","ru":"наличные"},{"en":"euro","ru":"евро"},{"en":"dollar","ru":"доллар"},{"en":"price","ru":"цена"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e03","hint":"Три глагола — про деньги.","explanation":"Buy — покупать, pay — платить, cost — стоить, wear — носить, need — нуждаться.","difficulty":1,"words":["buy","pay","cost","wear","need"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"buy","ru":"покупать"},{"en":"pay","ru":"платить"},{"en":"cost","ru":"стоить"},{"en":"wear","ru":"носить"},{"en":"need","ru":"нуждаться"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e04","hint":"Её носят зимой.","explanation":"Coat — «пальто»: [koʊt].","difficulty":1,"words":["coat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"coat","distractors":["shirt","dress"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e05","hint":"Их носят на ногах и они обычно синие.","explanation":"Jeans — «джинсы»: [dʒiːnz].","difficulty":1,"words":["jeans"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"jeans","distractors":["shirt","shoes"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e06","hint":"Женская одежда.","explanation":"Dress — «платье»: [dres].","difficulty":1,"words":["dress"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"dress","distractors":["coat","shirt"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e07","hint":"Цена высокая.","explanation":"Expensive — «дорогой», cheap — «дешёвый».","difficulty":1,"words":["cheap","expensive"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"дорогой","options":["expensive","cheap","small"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e08","hint":"Цена низкая.","explanation":"Cheap [tʃiːp] — «дешёвый».","difficulty":1,"words":["cheap"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"cheap","options":["дешёвый","дорогой","красивый"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e09","hint":"Гласный как в work.","explanation":"Shirt [ʃɝːt] — «рубашка».","difficulty":1,"words":["shirt","shoes","dress"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"shirt","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["shirt","shoes","dress"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e10","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"The coat is expensive — «пальто дорогое».","difficulty":1,"words":["expensive","coat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"The coat is expensive.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e11","hint":"Пять букв.","explanation":"Money [ˈmʌni] — «деньги». Несчитаемое слово.","difficulty":1,"words":["money"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"деньги","answers":["money"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e12","hint":"Четыре буквы.","explanation":"Size [saɪz] — «размер».","difficulty":1,"words":["size"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"размер","answers":["size"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e13","hint":"Одежду носят.","explanation":"I wear a coat every day. Wear — «носить».","difficulty":1,"words":["buy","cost","coat","wear"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ a coat every day.","translation":"Я ношу пальто каждый день.","answers":[["wear"]],"options":["wear","buy","cost"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l01.e14","hint":"Ударение в середине.","explanation":"ex-PEN-sive — ударение на второй слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["expensive"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"expensive","syllables":["ex","pen","sive"],"stress":1}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02","kind":"grammar","title":"Сколько стоит?","grammar":"a1.how-much","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e01","hint":"Для цены.","explanation":"How much is this shirt? Цену спрашивают с How much.","difficulty":1,"words":["shirt","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"How ___ is this shirt?","translation":"Сколько стоит эта рубашка?","answers":[["much"]],"options":["much","many","old"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e02","hint":"Jeans — множественное число.","explanation":"How much are these jeans? Jeans — как «они».","difficulty":1,"words":["jeans","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"How much ___ these jeans?","translation":"Сколько стоят эти джинсы?","answers":[["are"]],"options":["are","is","does"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e03","hint":"Считаем штуки.","explanation":"How many shirts do you have? Для количества штук — How many.","difficulty":1,"words":["shirt","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"How ___ shirts do you have?","translation":"Сколько у вас рубашек?","answers":[["many"]],"options":["many","much","old"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e04","hint":"О вещи — с -s.","explanation":"The coat costs two hundred euros. С it — cost с -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["cost","euro","coat"],"grammar":["a1.how-much","a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The coat ___ two hundred euros.","translation":"Пальто стоит двести евро.","answers":[["costs"]],"options":["costs","cost","is cost"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e05","hint":"После does глагол без окончания.","explanation":"How much does the bag cost? После does — cost без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["cost","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much","a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"How much does the bag ___?","translation":"Сколько стоит сумка?","answers":[["cost"]],"options":["cost","costs","costing"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e06","hint":"Цена — не количество.","explanation":"How much is this shirt? Цену спрашивают с How much.","difficulty":1,"words":["shirt","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"error_correction","text":"How many is this shirt?","wrong":"many","correction":"much","options":["much","old","far"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e07","hint":"Нужен вспомогательный глагол.","explanation":"How much does the bag cost? В вопросе с cost нужен does.","difficulty":1,"words":["cost","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"How much costs the bag?","wrong":"costs the bag","correction":"does the bag cost","options":["does the bag cost","is the bag cost","do the bag costs"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e08","hint":"С it — окончание.","explanation":"Правильно: It costs ten euros.","difficulty":1,"words":["cost","euro"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"It cost ten euros.","wrong":"cost","correction":"costs","options":["costs","costing","is cost"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e09","hint":"Образец: How much + is.","explanation":"Правильно: How much is this coat?","difficulty":1,"words":["coat","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Сколько стоит это пальто?","answer":"How much is this coat?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["many","are"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e10","hint":"Туфли — они.","explanation":"How much are these shoes? Shoes — множественное число.","difficulty":1,"words":["shoes","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Сколько стоят эти туфли?","answer":"How much are these shoes?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["is","many"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e11","hint":"It is + цена.","explanation":"It is twenty euros. Euro получает -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["euro"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Это двадцать евро.","answers":["It is twenty euros."]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e12","hint":"How many + множественное число.","explanation":"Правильно: How many bags do you have?","difficulty":2,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.how-much","a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Сколько у вас сумок?","answers":["How many bags do you have?"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e13","hint":"Вопрос о цене.","explanation":"How much is the coat? — «Сколько стоит пальто?»","difficulty":1,"words":["coat","how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"How much is the coat?","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["How much is the coat?","How many coats are there?","How old is the coat?"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e14","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"It is forty euros — «сорок евро».","difficulty":1,"words":["euro"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"It is forty euros.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u08.l02.e15","hint":"Интонация идёт вниз.","explanation":"How much — [haʊ mʌtʃ]: два слова произносятся слитно.","difficulty":1,"words":["jeans","how-much"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"How much are these jeans?"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"Can I…? Can you…?","grammar":"a1.can-requests","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e01","hint":"Просим разрешения.","explanation":"Can I pay by card? Can — «можно».","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ I pay by card?","translation":"Можно заплатить картой?","answers":[["Can"]],"options":["Can","Do","Am"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e02","hint":"После can глагол без окончания.","explanation":"Can you give me the bag? После can — give без -s и без to.","difficulty":1,"words":["give","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Can you ___ me the bag?","translation":"Вы можете дать мне сумку?","answers":[["give"]],"options":["give","gives","to give"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e03","hint":"После can — без окончания.","explanation":"Can I try on this coat? Try on — «примерять».","difficulty":1,"words":["coat","try-on","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Can I ___ on this coat?","translation":"Можно примерить это пальто?","answers":[["try"]],"options":["try","tries","trying"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e04","hint":"Короткий ответ.","explanation":"Yes, you can. Короткий ответ повторяет can.","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Can I pay by card? — Yes, you ___.","translation":"Можно заплатить картой? — Да.","answers":[["can"]],"options":["can","do","are"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e05","hint":"Отрицание с can.","explanation":"No, you can't. Can't — «нельзя».","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","cash","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Can I pay with cash? — No, you ___.","translation":"Можно заплатить наличными? — Нет.","answers":[["can't"]],"options":["can't","don't","isn't"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e06","hint":"У can нет окончания.","explanation":"She can pay by card. Can не получает -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ pay by card.","translation":"Она может заплатить картой.","answers":[["can"]],"options":["can","cans","is can"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e07","hint":"Лишнее слово.","explanation":"Can I pay by card? После can — глагол без to.","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Can I to pay by card?","wrong":"to pay","correction":"pay","options":["pay","pays","paying"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e08","hint":"Окончание лишнее.","explanation":"He can pay by card. У can нет -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He cans pay by card.","wrong":"cans","correction":"can","options":["can","can't","is can"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e09","hint":"После can окончание не нужно.","explanation":"Can you give me the bag? После can — give.","difficulty":1,"words":["give","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Can you gives me the bag?","wrong":"gives","correction":"give","options":["give","giving","to give"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e10","hint":"Вы это уже говорили в кафе.","explanation":"Can I have a coffee? Это вежливая просьба.","difficulty":1,"words":["can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Можно мне кофе?","answer":"Can I have a coffee?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["do","to"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e11","hint":"Can + you + глагол.","explanation":"Правильно: Can you open the door?","difficulty":1,"words":["can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Вы можете открыть дверь?","answer":"Can you open the door?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["opens","to"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e12","hint":"Try on — «примерять».","explanation":"Can I try it on? Местоимение it стоит между try и on.","difficulty":2,"words":["try-on","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Можно мне это примерить?","answers":["Can I try it on?"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e13","hint":"С наличными — with.","explanation":"Can I pay with cash? Обычно говорят with cash.","difficulty":2,"words":["pay","cash","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Можно заплатить наличными?","answers":["Can I pay with cash?","Can I pay by cash?"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e14","hint":"Yes, you… или No, you…","explanation":"Короткий ответ: Yes, you can. или No, you can't.","difficulty":3,"words":["pay","can"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"Can I pay by card?","questionRu":"Продавец спрашивает: можно ли заплатить картой? Ответьте: Yes, you can. или No, you can't.","keywords":[["\\b(yes|no)\\b"],["\\byou (can|can't|cannot)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["Yes, you can.","No, you can't."]},{"id":"a1.u08.l03.e15","hint":"Вежливая просьба.","explanation":"Can I — [kæn aɪ]. В вопросе can звучит почти как [kən].","difficulty":1,"words":["coat","try-on","can"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"Can I try on this coat, please?"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04","kind":"grammar","title":"Me, him, her, them","grammar":"a1.object-pronouns","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e01","hint":"Все формы стоят после глагола.","explanation":"Me — мне, him — ему, her — ей, us — нам, them — им.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"me","ru":"мне, меня"},{"en":"him","ru":"ему, его"},{"en":"her","ru":"ей, её"},{"en":"us","ru":"нам, нас"},{"en":"them","ru":"им, их"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e02","hint":"После глагола.","explanation":"Give me the bag. После глагола — me, а не I.","difficulty":1,"words":["give"],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Give ___ the bag, please.","translation":"Дайте мне сумку, пожалуйста.","answers":[["me"]],"options":["me","I","my"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e03","hint":"Речь о женщине.","explanation":"I like her. После глагола — her.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I like ___.","translation":"Она мне нравится.","answers":[["her"]],"options":["her","she","hers"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e04","hint":"О мужчине, после предлога.","explanation":"The coat is for him. После предлога — him.","difficulty":1,"words":["coat"],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The coat is for ___.","translation":"Пальто для него.","answers":[["him"]],"options":["him","he","his"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e05","hint":"О нескольких вещах.","explanation":"I like them. Jeans — множественное число, поэтому them.","difficulty":1,"words":["jeans"],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I like ___. (the jeans)","translation":"Они мне нравятся. (джинсы)","answers":[["them"]],"options":["them","they","it"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e06","hint":"О нескольких людях, включая вас.","explanation":"Give us the menu. После глагола — us.","difficulty":1,"words":["give"],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Give ___ the menu, please.","translation":"Дайте нам меню, пожалуйста.","answers":[["us"]],"options":["us","we","our"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e07","hint":"После глагола другая форма.","explanation":"Правильно: I like her.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I like she.","wrong":"she","correction":"her","options":["her","hers","he"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e08","hint":"После глагола другая форма.","explanation":"Правильно: Give me the bag.","difficulty":1,"words":["give"],"grammar":["a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Give I the bag.","wrong":"I","correction":"me","options":["me","my","mine"]},{"id":"a1.u08.l04.e09","hint":"После глагола другая форма.","explanation":"Правильно: We like them.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"gr