 pay with cash.","difficulty":3,"words":["pay","cash"],"grammar":["a1.can-requests"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"How do you pay?","questionRu":"Как вы платите в магазине? Ответьте: I pay by card. или I pay with cash.","keywords":[["\\bI pay\\b"],["\\b(by card|with cash|cash|card)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I pay by card.","I pay with cash."]},{"id":"a1.u08.l07.e08","hint":"План: что нужно → где → цена → оплата.","explanation":"Рассказывая о покупках, используйте need, cost, pay и buy. С he и she глагол получает -s. После глагола ставьте me, him, her, them.","difficulty":3,"words":["buy","pay","cost","money","cash","euro","dollar","cheap","expensive","shoes","coat","dress","need","give","can"],"grammar":["a1.how-much","a1.can-requests","a1.object-pronouns"],"troubles":[],"type":"write","task":"Напишите о покупке: что вам нужно, сколько это стоит, где вы это покупаете и как платите. Например: I need a new coat. It costs fifty euros. I pay by card.","minWords":30,"maxWords":90,"criteria":[{"id":"need","label":"Есть I need или I want","patterns":["\\bI (need|want)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"price","label":"Названа цена","patterns":["\\b(costs?|price|euros?|dollars?|rubles?)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"clothes","label":"Названа вещь","patterns":["\\b(shirt|jeans|shoes|coat|dress|bag|hat|jacket|phone|laptop|book|bread|coffee)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"pay","label":"Есть оплата: pay, buy","patterns":["\\b(pay|buy|buys|pays)\\b"],"required":true}],"commonErrors":[{"pattern":"\\bit cost\\b","message":"С it глагол cost получает -s: it costs."},{"pattern":"\\bhow many (is|are) \\b","message":"Для цены нужно How much, а не How many."},{"pattern":"\\bcan (to) [a-z]+\\b","message":"После can нет to: can pay."},{"pattern":"\\b(give|like|need) (I|he|she|we|they)\\b","message":"После глагола ставят me, him, her, us, them."},{"pattern":"\\b(he|she) (buy|need|pay|wear)\\b","message":"С he и she глагол получает -s: he buys, she needs."}],"samples":["I need a new coat. In the shop it costs two hundred euros. It is expensive. On Saturday I go to the market and I buy a coat for fifty euros. I pay with cash. I like it.","My sister needs a dress. It costs forty dollars and she can pay by card. I give her the money. We like the shop. I need new shoes too. They cost thirty dollars and they are cheap. I pay with cash."]}]}],"test":{"passScore":0.8,"exercises":[{"id":"a1.u08.test.e01","hint":"Три слова про вещи, два про деньги.","explanation":"Shirt — рубашка, coat — пальто, money — деньги, price — цена, buy — покупать.","difficulty":1,"words":["buy","price","money","shirt","coat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"shirt","ru":"рубашка"},{"en":"coat","ru":"пальто"},{"en":"money","ru":"деньги"},{"en":"price","ru":"цена"},{"en":"buy","ru":"покупать"}]},{"id":"a1.u08.test.e02","hint":"Цена низкая.","explanation":"Cheap — «дешёвый».","difficulty":1,"words":["cheap","expensive"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"дешёвый","options":["cheap","expensive","closed"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u08.test.e03","hint":"Женская одежда.","explanation":"Dress — «платье».","difficulty":1,"words":["dress"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"dress","distractors":["shirt","coat"]},{"id":"a1.u08.test.e04","hint":"Цена.","explanation":"Правильно: How much is this bag?","difficulty":1,"words":["how-much"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"How ___ is this bag?","translation":"Сколько стоит эта сумка?","answers":[["much"]],"options":["much","many","old"]},{"id":"a1.u08.test.e05","hint":"О вещи — с -s.","explanation":"Правильно: The coat costs fifty euros.","difficulty":1,"words":["cost","euro","coat"],"grammar":["a1.how-much"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The coat ___ fifty euros.","translation":"Пальто стоит пятьдесят евро.","answers":[["costs"]],"options":["costs","cost","is cost"]},{"id":"a1.u